{"type":"step-attempt","step":"design","sessionId":"b6285489-b93c-47fb-92b7-a062823799b0","outcome":{"verdict":"success","findingsPath":null,"error":null,"toolResult":{"ok":true,"reason":"Wrote design.md, spec.md, and tasks.md under specrunner/changes/staging-containment-followups/ on branch change/staging-containment-followups-2d0de90f. The plan closes both staging-containment gaps: (1) a byte-size guard (pipeline.maxStagedBytes, default 52428800) mirroring the file-count guard at the same pre-git-add point in the guarded branch of commit-push.ts, measuring uncompressed lstat bytes with delete-pending paths as 0 and fail-closed on other measurement errors, raising a distinct STAGED_BYTES_LIMIT_EXCEEDED escalation (independent of the file-count guard, no push-path change); and (2) generated-artifact / scratch-file hygiene added to the shared COMMIT_DISCIPLINE fragment so all producer prompts inherit it from one edit. Tasks cover config type/validation, docs, and new (non-mutating) unit/integration/config/prompt-contract tests keeping the existing TC-001..TC-020 suite green. No source files were edited — planning only.","status":"success"},"followUpAttempts":0,"transientRetryAttempts":0,"addedTurns":{"reportRetry":0,"postWork":0,"outputRepair":0}},"startedAt":"2026-08-05T13:50:13.419Z","endedAt":"2026-08-05T14:00:23.689Z","commitOid":"602247233c9d6113b8a59fb56c1d6162c22e1f2c"}
